{
  "id": "3dprFacebook005",
  "name": "05 Facebook Publisher",
  "active": false,
  "isArchived": false,
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "d35a3bbf-bbcc-5dc7-aa6d-6e39bbceb354",
      "name": "Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -360,
        -240
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Facebook Page (official Meta Graph API)\n\nPublishes to a Page:\n- Images: `POST /{page-id}/photos`\n- Videos: `POST /{page-id}/videos`\n\nPage-only guard: fetches the Page token for `FACEBOOK_PAGE_ID`, checks `GET /me` with that\ntoken returns the same Page id, posts with the Page token, then verifies the post `from.id`.\nNever posts as a personal profile.\n\nRequires:\n- n8n credential **Facebook Graph account** (user or Page token that can read the Page `access_token`, with `pages_manage_posts`)\n- `FACEBOOK_PAGE_ID` and `META_GRAPH_VERSION` in `.env`\n\n`DRY_RUN=true` stops at Duplicate Check \u2014 nothing is posted.\n",
        "width": 360,
        "height": 320,
        "color": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "dc08b0ae-0f01-55b5-94e8-334a24a95d39",
      "name": "When Called by Another Workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflowTrigger",
